   fixed-width delimiter=[3,5,3] autostrip: [(1, 2.5, 'abc'), (10, -3.0, 'xyz')]
ok   genfromtxt delimiter as a sequence of field widths (fixed-width columns), autostrip=True
ok   genfromtxt usecols by field names
ok   genfromtxt invalid_raise=False skips the bad row with a ConversionWarning
ok   genfromtxt invalid_raise=True (default) raises ValueError on the bad row
ok   genfromtxt with a structured dtype and no names: fields named from the dtype
